 * glyphs ("Γ" shapes) feeds two gates. Left: a gate trained on the rotation label weights four expert
 * lanes; every expert runs on every glyph (the gated lane bright, the others faint copies). Right: the
 * same kind of gate turns each glyph back by every candidate angle (the likely one bright) and all copies
 * pass through ONE shared channel. Both land close together, the shared one very slightly higher.
 * Schematic only: no axes, no numbers.
 */
